// TEST WEAPONS (WP-051), one per class: they exist so the class movesets can be swung in the
// golden replays (game/tests/replays/wp051_*.lfr). They are not the game's weapons. WP-053
// adds the real weapons from docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon list", and these
// can then go. IDs are wpn_test_<class>; registry numbers 13900-13905. WP-052 appends the
// test weapons of the other classes (registry numbers 18900-18906).
